# FinFlow Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Note: The FinFlow frontend uses relative API routing (/api/v1/...) 
# which Vite proxies directly to http://localhost:5000 in development (see vite.config.js).
# 
# In production, when served behind a reverse proxy (e.g. Nginx, Caddy, Cloudflare),
# API traffic to /api is routed directly to the backend service.
#
# Any client-side environment variables added in future phases must be prefixed with VITE_.
